# Icons: Lucide

Use icons from `lucide-react`.

- Import the named icon: `import { Smile } from 'lucide-react'`
- Size and color with Tailwind on the icon (`h-4 w-4 text-ink-soft`)
- Draw a custom SVG only when the user asks for a custom icon
